        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1931 Bamboo Door Stop</b> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBring an Asian or Tiki decorative touch to your home , bungalow or office with this unique Bamboo Styled Door Stop. The Satin Nickel bamboo door stops are hand finished in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions International.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-bamboo-door-pull-first-impressions-gdp625sbr\"><b>Bamboo Style Door Pulls</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/small-bamboo-shower-door-pull-first-impressions-sd-gdp625005sbr\"><b>Bamboo Shower Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis bamboo door stop screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom, to protect the door hardware and wall. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 1931 Bamboo Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Screw Stud</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: White</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/stops-bumpers\">Door Stoppers</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (2)  Left.\r\n</p> -->",
